# Repeat Offender ({2}{B}): "If this creature is suspected, put a +1/+1 counter on it. Otherwise, suspect it." (CR 701.60a). Bot1 casts the 2/1 with Mox Jet and Mox Pearl, and with only Mox Emerald, Mox Ruby and Mox Sapphire to pay the ability has no black source and is refused; a second Mox Jet makes it affordable and the pool is empty right after, so exactly {2}{B} was taken. The first resolution suspects it (menace, can't block, still 2/1, no counter); on turn 3 two more activations each put one counter on it, 4/3 and still suspected.

